//@version=5
indicator("UCTPROBE_VW_OBJECT_GC_B", overlay = false)

// ─── 2026-09-28 — OBJECT-LANE TRIAGE C7, PROBE B OF 4: ONE DIMENSION AT A TIME ──
//
// Probe A reproduces the corpus split (contraction-box 50, makuchaku 51,
// ultimate-pivot 51 at the default cap ≈ 50). THIS probe keeps A's cap (default,
// no max_*_count) and changes exactly ONE thing per family, so each family pair
// A.On / B.On isolates one suspect. Rules H1–H7 are defined in
// `vw-object-gc-a.pine`; in one line each: H1 strict ≤ cap (ours), H2 cap+1 after
// any create, H3a/b bar-end trim (last bar trimmed / not), H4 a bar's own creates
// are spared, H5 local-block creates keep one more, H6 sporadic keeps one more,
// H7 na coordinates are collected differently.
//
//   family  B's shape                          vs A's            isolates
//   O1 boxes  "BB <bar>"  global, every bar,   A.O1 (na coords   H7 NA-COORD
//                         REAL coordinates      on most bars)
//   O2 labels "BL <bar>"  inside `if`, EVERY   A.O2 (sporadic)   H6 RATE
//                         bar, real
//   O3 lines  (no text)   GLOBAL scope, every  A.O3 (inside      H5 SCOPE (k = 3)
//                         bar, 3 per bar,       `if`)
//                         width 1, 2, 3
//
//   held at the end    H1   H2   H3a  H3b  H4   H5   H6   H7
//   O1 boxes           50   51   50   51   50   50   50   ≠ A.O1
//   O2 labels          50   51   50   51   50   51   50   —
//   O3 lines           50   51   50   53   50   50   50   —
//
//   A.O1 == B.O1   ⇒ na coordinates do not matter (H7 dead)
//   A.O2 − B.O2 = 1 ⇒ rate matters (H6); = 0 with both 51 ⇒ scope (H5) or H2
//   A.O3 − B.O3 = 1 ⇒ scope matters (H5); = 0 ⇒ it does not
//
// ⭐ READ BY ID. Per bar the calls run in THIS order, every bar: box, label,
// line w1, w2, w3 — five consecutive ids per bar, so bar b's ids are
// (base + 5b … base + 5b + 4) and every held line's bar is decodable. Box and
// label text carry the bar. The capture's x/y are vendor indices, NOT bar_index.
//
//   B00  bar_index                     CONTROL
//   B01  barstate.isconfirmed ? 1 : 0  last bar 0 = captured while FORMING
//   B02  barstate.islast ? 1 : 0
//
// ⛔ CAPTURE with probe A, same session, same two charts: AMEX:SPY 1D and
// AMEX:SPY W, inputs at defaults (none), AFTER THE CLOSE.
//
// ours today (2026-09-28, `runOurSide` at d24d526e2 on the NYSE:RDDT 1D fixture's
// 632 bars): TRANSLATES clean — 3 plots, 5 object ops, 0 drops. Holds 50 / 50 / 50
// (H1): boxes BB 582..631, labels BL 582..631, lines 50.

plot(bar_index, "B00_bar_index_CONTROL")
plot(barstate.isconfirmed ? 1 : 0, "B01_isconfirmed")
plot(barstate.islast ? 1 : 0, "B02_islast")

// O1 — global scope, every bar, REAL coordinates (A.O1 with na coordinates removed)
box.new(bar_index, 1.0, bar_index + 1, 0.0, text = "BB " + str.tostring(bar_index))

// O2 — inside `if`, EVERY bar (A.O2 with the sporadic schedule removed)
if close > 0
    label.new(bar_index, 1.0, "BL " + str.tostring(bar_index))

// O3 — GLOBAL scope, 3 per bar (A.O3 with the `if` removed)
line.new(bar_index, 1.0, bar_index + 1, 1.0, width = 1)
line.new(bar_index, 2.0, bar_index + 1, 2.0, width = 2)
line.new(bar_index, 3.0, bar_index + 1, 3.0, width = 3)
